SQL> 
SQL> -- 2. Verrouillage du compte
SQL> ALTER USER ali ACCOUNT LOCK;

User altered.

SQL> PROMPT === Etat apres ALTER USER ali ACCOUNT LOCK ===
=== Etat apres ALTER USER ali ACCOUNT LOCK ===
SQL> SELECT username, account_status, lock_date, expiry_date
  2    FROM dba_users WHERE username = 'ALI';

USERNAME     ACCOUNT_STATUS   LOCK_DATE 	   EXPIRY_DATE
------------ ---------------- -------------------- --------------------
ALI	     LOCKED	      29-OCT-26

1 row selected.

SQL> 
SQL> -- 3. Tentative de connexion sur un compte verrouille
SQL> CONNECT ali/"Ali#2027"@//localhost/FREEPDB1
ERROR:
ORA-28000: The account is locked; login denied.
Help: https://docs.oracle.com/error-help/db/ora-28000/


Warning: You are no longer connected to ORACLE.
SQL> 
SQL> -- Etat apres la tentative de connexion
SQL> CONNECT sys/"Admin#2026"@//localhost/FREEPDB1 AS SYSDBA
Connected.
SQL> PROMPT === Etat apres tentative de connexion (compte verrouille) ===
=== Etat apres tentative de connexion (compte verrouille) ===
SQL> SELECT username, account_status, lock_date, expiry_date
  2    FROM dba_users WHERE username = 'ALI';

USERNAME     ACCOUNT_STATUS   LOCK_DATE 	   EXPIRY_DATE
------------ ---------------- -------------------- --------------------
ALI	     LOCKED	      29-OCT-26

1 row selected.

SQL> 
SQL> -- 4. Deverrouillage
SQL> ALTER USER ali ACCOUNT UNLOCK;

User altered.

